WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.152
"Ugh!" Sid said.

2
00:00:10.153 --> 00:00:12.523
"The rat's hole!

3
00:00:12.524 --> 00:00:16.394
We built our fort over it."

4
00:00:16.395 --> 00:00:19.010
Squeak! Squeak!

5
00:00:19.018 --> 00:00:22.136
Rex held his ears.

6
00:00:22.137 --> 00:00:28.492
"The rat is loud!"

7
00:00:28.493 --> 00:00:33.380
Tor took out her ball.

8
00:00:33.381 --> 00:00:36.468
She covered the hole with it.

9
00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:39.427
"Good!" Sara said.

10
00:00:39.428 --> 00:00:49.288
"Now we can't hear the rat!"

11
00:00:49.289 --> 00:00:55.217
Pow! The rat hit the ball.

12
00:00:55.218 --> 00:00:57.653
Sara caught it.

13
00:00:57.654 --> 00:01:00.819
Squeak! Squeak! Squeak!

14
00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:04.863
"Catch, Tor!" Sara threw the ball.

15
00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:08.247
Tor caught it.

16
00:01:08.248 --> 00:01:10.860
She covered the hole again.

17
00:01:10.861 --> 00:01:15.264
Pow! The ball flew again.

18
00:01:15.265 --> 00:01:17.888
This time Rex caught it.

19
00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:20.736
SQUEAK! SQUEAK!

20
00:01:20.737 --> 00:01:23.906
Tor groaned.

21
00:01:23.907 --> 00:01:27.339
"This rat is too noisy!"

22
00:01:27.340 --> 00:01:30.587
"Is the rat mad?" Sid asked.

23
00:01:30.588 --> 00:01:33.759
"I think so!" Sara said.

24
00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:39.033
"Hmm." Rex peeked in the hole.

25
00:01:39.034 --> 00:01:41.732
Rex gasped.

26
00:01:41.733 --> 00:01:44.370
The rat was smiling!

27
00:01:44.371 --> 00:01:51.782
Rex laughed. "The rat just wants to play!"

28
00:01:51.783 --> 00:01:54.154
Rex put the ball over the hole.

29
00:01:54.155 --> 00:02:07.975
Pow!

